temFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯云发布云端研发智能体CodeBuddy NPC，实现端到端自主研发</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek创始人梁文锋明确最强模型将开源，阐述开源与商业利润逻辑</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Alphabet发布最新财报：AI功能推动谷歌搜索收入增长17%且月活破10亿</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">面壁智能MiniCPM端侧大模型正式接入三星Galaxy Z Fold8系列旗舰手机</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/157d8eb7723d022c8c8e87597fef0ef8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">面壁智能宣布旗下MiniCPM系列端侧大模型深度赋能三星Galaxy AI，正式进入三星Galaxy Z Fold8及Galaxy Z Fold8 Ultra全球旗舰产品线，这是国产端侧大模型首次搭载于国际头部手机厂商的全球旗舰机型。此次合作中，MiniCPM模型为三星设备提供本地化的文本理解与多模态感知能力，无需依赖云端即可处理数据，在提升响应速度的同时增强了用户隐私保护。Galaxy Z Fold8采用8英寸“阔折叠”设计，配备双5000万像素摄像头及4800mAh电池；Galaxy Z Fold8 Ultra则搭载2亿像素主摄与5000mAh电池。面壁智能由清华大学自然语言处理实验室孵化，核心团队包括李大海、刘知远及曾国洋等专家。此次技术落地标志着国产端侧模型在国际高端移动设备市场的突破，为全球用户提供更</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里真武M890超节点适配Qwen3.8大模型，已上线阿里云百炼平台提供推理服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/aeaad5527f408581b6926a21e6748e37.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月23日，阿里云宣布阿里真武M890超节点正式适配旗舰大模型Qwen3.8，并同步上线阿里云百炼平台对外提供推理服务。作为国内首个支撑超2万亿参数大模型稳定运行的超节点系统，真武M890实现了国产软硬件协同在算力调度层面的关键突破。Qwen3.8参数规模达2.4万亿，传统AI集群在应对此类超大规模模型时常受限于节点间通信带宽。真武M890通过优化集群高速互联技术与通信架构，有效解决了超高吞吐、低延迟及高并发推理场景下的性能瓶颈，确保模型运行的稳定性与高效性。此次服务上线，意味着企业与开发者可直接通过百炼平台调用万亿参数级别的推理能力，为下一代超大规模AI应用的商业化部署提供了坚实的算力底座。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯云发布云端研发智能体CodeBuddy NPC，实现端到端自主研发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7331cc776ae850efdb0160a4612f1883.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯云正式推出云端研发智能体CodeBuddy NPC，标志着其CodeBuddy代码助手向企业级自主研发智能体演进。该产品深度集成腾讯云CNB研发平台，原生打通Issue、代码仓库、PR及CI/CD全流程数据。开发者仅需下发任务指令，CodeBuddy NPC即可自主完成方案规划、编码、提交PR及自动化测试，并能根据CI运行结果实现自我迭代与报错修复。此外，该智能体支持编排多角色协同的NPC Team，实现项目管理、内容创作与代码评审的分工协作。在性能优化方面，通过改进提示词、工具调用及缓存机制，CodeBuddy NPC首轮Token消耗较早期版本降低超90%，降至约2000个，并支持按任务难度灵活切换模型。此次发布推动了企业级AI研发生态向深度工程化协同转型，实现了云端原生研发链路的智能化重构。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek创始人梁文锋明确最强模型将开源，阐述开源与商业利润逻辑</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a325057d23ea1649de77e544020d4b15.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek创始人梁文锋在近日的投资者交流会上明确表示，公司将坚持开源策略，包括最强模型在内的所有模型均会开源。梁文锋从财务视角拆解了开源与商业利润的关系，他指出，若目标是实现约6倍利润（十个月回本），开源对商业模式并无影响；但若追求100倍暴利，开源则会因第三方独立部署及成本优势而压缩定价空间。他将6倍利润定位为DeepSeek的克制策略，旨在通过长久经营提升实现AGI的概率。此外，梁文锋强调DeepSeek目前处于中等规模的“甜区”，即便模型开源，外部复现并达到同等低成本的门槛依然极高。他认为通过舍弃非核心业务，团队在保持技术领先的同时无需通过加班实现高强度研发，这种模式反而更具竞争优势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Alphabet发布最新财报：AI功能推动谷歌搜索收入增长17%且月活破10亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0b6e43fdf05ccef5bf912a32e23d7c3b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Alphabet发布最新财报显示，得益于AI Overview及AI Mode等生成式AI功能的强力驱动，谷歌搜索业务收入同比强劲增长17%。自去年10月全球推广以来，AI Mode月活跃用户已突破10亿大关，不仅带动搜索查询量创下历史新高，每周还为外部网站输送数十亿次点击。本季度Alphabet整体营收达1198亿美元，同比大增24%。尽管AI功能提升了搜索生态黏性，但皮查伊披露的数据引发了数字出版行业的担忧，部分媒体指出AI直接生成解答导致传统网站引流压力增大。此次财报验证了生成式AI正在重塑信息分发与流量分配逻辑，如何在提升用户搜索体验与维护内容创作者生态平衡之间取得可持续的契合，已成为搜索引擎演进的核心课题。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
